WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.976 --> 00:00:15.716
Tu travailles du lundi au vendredi ?
Do you work Monday to Friday?

2
00:00:15.816 --> 00:00:22.820
Oui, de neuf heures à dix-sept heures. Mercredi matin, j'ai une réunion.
Yes, from nine to five. On Wednesday morning, I have a meeting.

3
00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:26.396
Tu es libre jeudi après-midi ?
Are you free on Thursday afternoon?

4
00:00:26.496 --> 00:00:31.292
Jeudi, j'ai rendez-vous chez le dentiste à quinze heures.
Thursday, I have an appointment at the dentist's at three p.m.

5
00:00:31.392 --> 00:00:34.196
Alors vendredi ?
Then Friday?

6
00:00:34.296 --> 00:00:40.052
Vendredi matin, c'est parfait. On déjeune ensemble ?
Friday morning is perfect. Shall we have lunch together?
